OL,3,GNEWSALife-saving dog honoured for
OL,4,Abravery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog who can alert his owner to
OL,7,Fpotentially fatal changes to her health
OL,8,Fhas won a bravery award.
OL,10,FMedical alert assistance dog Spring, a
OL,11,Fcocker spaniel, won a Burns Bravery
OL,12,FAward for his work alerting Michelle
OL,13,FSutherland to changes in her health due
OL,14,Fto Addison's disease.
OL,16,FThe rare condition causes glands above
OL,17,Fthe kidneys to not work properly and
OL,18,Fleads to a drop in cortisol.
